Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.44,Hdr,,0,0,0,,November 11, 1973 - Kikuka Sho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Round the final turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Haiseiko leads! Haiseiko in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:06.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Can he avenge the Derby? Haiseiko leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Silver Land, with Machikane Hachiro chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Take Hope is closing from the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Derby winner's pride - Take Hope is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Haiseiko? Take Hope? Haiseiko? Take Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:20.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The monster Haiseiko, and outside him Derby winner Take Hope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:23.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Haiseiko hangs on! Take Hope closes in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:26.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Haiseiko? Take Hope? Haiseiko? Take Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two horses together at the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Take Hope just got there - Take Hope by a whisker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Take Hope completes the Derby-Kikuka Sho double
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:41.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,The rivalry goes to Take Hope once again